{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/items/176775/", "pk": 176775, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/", "pk": 45475, "shortname": "floridakeysventures", "name": "Florida Keys Ventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Key West History And Culture Southernmost Walking Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Key West History And Culture Southernmost Walking Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "Meet The Locals, On Foot, At Eye Level\n\nIf you’re like us, you think of travel as more than just “going places.” You crave experience and discovery, not just monuments and museums. You want to understand what’s behind the touristic façade that most people never penetrate. That’s why the Southernmost Walking Tour is the best way to immerse you into the history and culture of Key West! When you’re on foot, the world can’t slide past you faster than you can absorb it. You’ll have time – and proximity – to get up close to the region’s culture and natural history. \n\nStart your tour at the famous Cuban sandal factory - Kino Sandals before heading off toward the Southernmost Point of the continental United States. Along the way, our incredibly knowledgeable and well-connected local guides will show you the most popular landmarks and introduce you to local culture. By the time you’re finished, you’ll have a uniquely fun perspective of our tiny island!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "Please plan to **10 minutes** before the tour's start time! There are no bathrooms along the way, so please make sure to use the restroom before the tour begins. The tour will take place, rain or shine! \n\n**What to Bring**\n\n- Hat, sunglasses, and sunblock is a must.\n- Bring at least one bottle of water for yourself. We will walk and it gets hot.\n- Wear comfortable clothing and shoes. Sneakers are the best option.\n- Tour guide gratuity is not included in your ticket. If you had a great\ntime, please tip your guide! It is standard in the service industry to tip\n10-20% of the ticket price.\n- Camera or your phone to take pictures.\n- Your adventurous spirit :)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "1 hour 45 minutes • All Ages", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/items/176775/images/305423/", "pk": 305423, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4HsbXVxTRSXODU1F49pa", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4HsbXVxTRSXODU1F49pa", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridakeysventures/items/176775/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4HsbXVxTRSXODU1F49pa", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4HsbXVxTRSXODU1F49pa", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls":